E</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nobs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1109.762</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mean </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meanb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div>When I run it, I get the following error message:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#000000\"><div>Error in lavSampleStatsFromMoments(sample.cov = sample.cov, sample.mean = sample.mean,  : </div><div>  lavaan ERROR: please provide row/col names for the covariance matrix!</div></font></div></code></div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>The row/col names of the covariance matrix are:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">CSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bswop3sw&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bswop5sw&quot;</span><span style